      "displayDate": "Jan 17, 1977 • 10:00 AM",
      "content": "I want to make sure all our local veterans are aware of the burial allowance available to them. The VA provides a payment of up to $250 toward these expenses for eligible veterans.",
      "person_id": "p_va_rep",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2027-1.jpg"
    },
    {
