      "handle": "@HomeFromNam",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-18T13:45:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 18, 1977 • 1:45 PM",
      "content": "The VA also provides an American flag to drape the casket of a veteran upon request. It's an important part of honoring those who served.",
      "person_id": "p_veteran_01",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%2027-1.jpg"
    },
    {
